  "name": "框选",
  "tags": [
    "拖拽",
    "交互"
  ],
  "summary": "在空白处按下拖出选择框，框到的对象同时高亮选中；松手后选框消失、选中态保留。",
  "usage": "桌面端的图标网格、文件列表、画布元素：需要一次选中多个相邻对象（批量移动、删除、导出）。",
  "caution": "移动端没有空白拖拽的余裕，改用长按进入多选；选中态要有更明确的视觉（勾选角标）而不只是描边；列表很长时优先用复选框。",
  "hint": "在空白处按住拖动，框住的对象会被选中",
  "prompt": "【框选】目标：在对象网格的空白处按下拖动，出现半透明选择框；框到的对象实时高亮，松手后选框消失、选中态保留，底部显示已选数量。\n\n1) **画布尺寸跟视口走**：弹窗（约 740×680）里画布应该到 480×280 这种量级，不要写死成卡片预览的 330×132——否则弹窗里画布只占中间一小块，周围全空。基础样式给弹窗尺寸、`@media (max-height:420px)` 压回卡片尺寸；item 尺寸也随媒体查询调整（56×46 ↔ 40×32）。\n\n2) **对象铺满画布**：item 用百分比定位（7%/40%/73% × 12%/56%），不要在窄画布里挤在左上。\n\n3) 开始条件：pointerdown 不是落在 .item 上就能开始，写 `if(e.target.closest('.item')) return;`；不要写 `e.target !== canvas`。\n\n4) 拖动：记录起点（相对 canvas 坐标），pointermove 算矩形；位移 <3px 视为点击。\n\n5) 实时判定：每次 move 遍历 item rect 与 marquee 相交测试，命中加 .sel；松手再判定一次。\n\n6) 视觉：marquee 边框 1px 品牌色、背景 12% 品牌淡底、pointer-events:none；.item.sel 品牌色边框 + 9% 淡底 + 右上角小圆点。\n\n7) 点击空白（未拖动）→ 清空；Esc 清空。\n\n8) 无障碍：canvas role=\"group\"；item role=\"option\" + aria-selected。\n\n9) 坑：坐标相对 canvas；marquee 必须 pointer-events:none；canvas 要 user-select:none；pointerup / pointercancel / lostpointercapture 都要结束拖动。\n\n10) 配色：marquee 与选中态用 var(--ui-brand)。\n\n11) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（光标从空白处按下 → 斜向拖出覆盖 B/C/E/F 的框 → 松手 → 停 1.2 秒 → 清空）；演示光标逐帧跟随。\n\n12) 使用场景：桌面图标网格、文件列表、画布元素批量选择；移动端改长按多选；超长列表用复选框。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;padding:20px}\n\n/* 弹窗里给足画布；卡片预览（≤420 高）再压缩 */\n.canvas{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:480px;height:280px;border-radius:14px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);overflow:hidden;\n  user-select:none;touch-action:none;cursor:crosshair}\n\n.item{position:absolute;width:56px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n  font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text-dim);background:var(--ui-surface-2);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  transition:border-color .12s ease,background .12s ease,color .12s ease}\n.item.sel{border-color:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 9%,transparent)}\n.item.sel::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;right:4px;top:4px;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:var(--ui-brand);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ui-surface)}\n\n.marquee{position:absolute;display:none;border:1px solid var(--ui-brand);border-radius:4px;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent);pointer-events:none;z-index:3}\n\n.foot{font-size:12px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);height:18px}\n.foot b{color:var(--ui-text);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px;gap:6px}\n  .canvas{max-width:300px;height:112px;border-radius:12px}\n  .item{width:40px;height:32px;font-size:10px;border-radius:8px}\n  .foot{font-size:10px;height:12px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .item{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"canvas\" id=\"canvas\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"对象网格\">\n  <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"a\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">A</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"b\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">B</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"c\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">C</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"d\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">D</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"e\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">E</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"f\" role=\"option\" aria-selected=\"false\">F</div>\n  <div class=\"marquee\" id=\"marquee\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"foot\">已选 <b id=\"count\">0</b> 项</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var canvas = document.getElementById('canvas'),\n      marquee = document.getElementById('marquee'),\n      countEl = document.getElementById('count'),\n      items = [].slice.call(canvas.querySelectorAll('.item'));\n\n  /* 百分比定位：对象铺满整个画布，不留大片点不动的空白 */\n  var LAYOUT = [\n    { x: 7, y: 12 }, { x: 40, y: 12 }, { x: 73, y: 12 },\n    { x: 7, y: 56 }, { x: 40, y: 56 }, { x: 73, y: 56 }\n  ];\n  items.forEach(function(el, i){\n    el.style.left = LAYOUT[i].x + '%';\n    el.style.top = LAYOUT[i].y + '%';\n  });\n\n  var startX = 0, startY = 0, dragging = false, moved = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function relPos(e){\n    var r = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    return { x: e.clientX - r.left, y: e.clientY - r.top };\n  }\n\n  function inRect(itemRect, box){\n    return !(itemRect.right < box.left || itemRect.left > box.right ||\n             itemRect.bottom < box.top || itemRect.top > box.bottom);\n  }\n\n  /* box 为 null 表示清空选择，不能当成「全部命中」 */\n  function updateSelection(box){\n    items.forEach(function(el){\n      var hit = box ? inRect(el.getBoundingClientRect(), box) : false;\n      el.classList.toggle('sel', hit);\n      el.setAttribute('aria-selected', hit ? 'true' : 'false');\n    });\n    countEl.textContent = String(canvas.querySelectorAll('.item.sel').length);\n  }\n\n  function onDown(e){\n    /* 只要不是按在对象上，画布内任何位置都能开始框选 */\n    if(e.target && e.target.closest && e.target.closest('.item')) return;\n    var p = relPos(e);\n    startX = p.x;\n    startY = p.y;\n    dragging = true;\n    moved = false;\n    marquee.style.display = 'none';\n    marquee.style.left = startX + 'px';\n    marquee.style.top = startY + 'px';\n    marquee.style.width = '0px';\n    marquee.style.height = '0px';\n    if(canvas.setPointerCapture && e.pointerId != null){\n      try { canvas.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(err){}\n    }\n  }\n\n  function onMove(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    var p = relPos(e);\n    var dx = p.x - startX, dy = p.y - startY;\n    if(!moved && (Math.abs(dx) > 3 || Math.abs(dy) > 3)) moved = true;\n    if(!moved) return;\n\n    var left = Math.min(startX, p.x);\n    var top = Math.min(startY, p.y);\n    var w = Math.abs(dx);\n    var h = Math.abs(dy);\n\n    marquee.style.display = 'block';\n    marquee.style.left = left + 'px';\n    marquee.style.top = top + 'px';\n    marquee.style.width = w + 'px';\n    marquee.style.height = h + 'px';\n\n    var cr = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var box = { left: cr.left + left, top: cr.top + top, right: cr.left + left + w, bottom: cr.top + top + h };\n    updateSelection(box);\n  }\n\n  function onUp(){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    dragging = false;\n    marquee.style.display = 'none';\n    if(!moved) updateSelection(null);\n  }\n\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown', onDown);\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointermove', onMove);\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointerup', onUp);\n  canvas.addEventListener('pointercancel', onUp);\n  canvas.addEventListener('lostpointercapture', onUp);\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    if(e.key === 'Escape') updateSelection(null);\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    updateSelection(null);\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    var cr = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n    /* 框住右两列的 B、C、E、F */\n    var startXp = cr.left + cr.width * 0.30;\n    var startYp = cr.bottom - 8;\n    var endXp = cr.left + cr.width * 0.96;\n    var endYp = cr.top + 8;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.el.style.transition = 'none';\n    c.el.style.left = startXp + 'px';\n    c.el.style.top = startYp + 'px';\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      canvas.setPointerCapture = function(){};\n      onDown({ clientX: startXp, clientY: startYp, target: canvas });\n\n      var t0 = performance.now();\n      var dur = 900;\n      function step(now){\n        var t = Math.min(1, (now - t0) / dur);\n        var e = t < .5 ? 2 * t * t : 1 - Math.pow(-2 * t + 2, 2) / 2;\n        var x = startXp + (endXp - startXp) * e;\n        var y = startYp + (endYp - startYp) * e;\n        onMove({ clientX: x, clientY: y });\n        c.el.style.left = x + 'px';\n        c.el.style.top = y + 'px';\n        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);\n        else {\n          c.release();\n          onUp();\n          setTimeout(function(){ if(c.hide) c.hide(); }, 400);\n        }\n      }\n      requestAnimationFrame(step);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4000); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
